              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "aumentar — \"to increase, to rise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Los precios aumentan cada año. Prices increase every year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Used for numbers that grow; subir is more everyday."
